og in options and a search bar for English music videos. Below, a horizontal language selector allows toggling between English, Tamil, Malayalam, Telugu, Kannada, and Hindi. Selecting a language displays a grid of artist sections, each with a placeholder image on the left, and two columns to the right: one for songs and one for videos (both with placeholders). Responsive design ensures usability across devices."\n}'}",
